  "body": "Premium Home & Land Package | Designed Around You\r\n\r\nDiscover an exceptional opportunity to secure a premium Home & Land Package in the heart of Long Bay.\r\n\r\nTwo architectural concept designs have already been prepared, offering the flexibility of either a contemporary two-storey or three-storey residence. The final design can be tailored to suit your lifestyle, family needs and budget, allowing you to create a home that is truly your own.\r\n\r\nPositioned to enjoy beautiful sea views, this is a rare opportunity to build a bespoke home in one of Auckland's most sought-after coastal communities.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n• Premium Home & Land Package \r\n\r\n• Beautiful sea views \r\n\r\n• Choice of two- or three-storey concept designs \r\n\r\n• Customisable floor plan and finishes \r\n\r\n• Contemporary architectural design \r\n\r\n• Quality construction with a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee \r\n\r\n• Close to Long Bay Beach, Regional Park, top schools and village amenities \r\n\r\n\r\nCreate a home that's designed around the way you live.\r\n\r\nContact us today to discuss design options, specifications, and package pricing.\r\n\r\nConjunctional Agents Welcome.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to working with fellow agents and helping your clients create their dream home in Long Bay.",
